r wheel, like how the website had it, or how the app has it right now, or a few other options, because the way it is now it took me a few minutes to figure it out.Other than that, this app is perfect. It is exactly what the title says, it works just fine, and it is extremely customizable.\nL48: # I love this app!\nL49: \nL50:     1.     2.     3.     4.     5. 11/14/2023\nL51: \nL52: cegeg\nL53: Personally, I use it for fun and when I have creativity blocks, and it’s worked fine! I love the idea of being able to buy other wheels people have for coins, and the daily spin for coins. Overall, it’s a really good app, and the customization options for the wheels are amazing. You can pick the slice color, text color, and text, and even more. And they don’t give you a few colors or color schemes to work with. You can use any color imaginable. Great app. If you are thinking about getting it, do it.\nL54: The only thing is, I would like other ways to make the wheel, like how it’s laid out in the website, if you were able to choose between how you customized your wheel, like how the website had it, or how the app has it right now, or a few other options, because the way it is now it took me a few minutes to figure it out.Other than that, this app is perfect. It is exactly what the title says, it works just fine, and it is extremely customizable.\nL55:   * ### This app is great! You should get it. Also, sorry that the text is so long. I’m talking about the ga\nL56: \nL57:     1.     2.     3.     4.     5. 09/08/2025\nL58: \nL59: ekh31115\nL60: This app is great. Obviously you can see the name, you spin the wheel. But it doesn’t give you wheels and then you just have to do what they want. You get to make your own and you can make as many as you want. Actually, I haven’t tested that out because I’ve only made five so far, but even if there is a limit, the limit is probably like 40! But when you make your wheels, you can change the color of the text and you can change the color of each part of the wheel. You can even pick a theme for the wheel.\nL61: It’s just so cool you can name Mom, and then you can save them and share! It’s really fun. I have made lots of wheels like a challenge wheel for dress to impress on Roblox, a wheel to figure out what chore to do first if you’re having trouble starting, a wheel to figure out what to pick up first if you’re trying to clean.\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nSpin The Wheel - Random Picker - Apps on Google Play (https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?hl=en_US&id=com.spinthewheeldecider)\nciteturn13view3 [wordlim: 200] Crawled: today; Content type: text/html; Source: open({\"ref_id\":\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?hl=en_US&id=com.spinthewheeldecider\",\"lineno\":null}); Total lines: 305\nL0: 【0†Games】【1†Apps】【2†Books】【3†Kids】\nL1: \nL2: 【0†google_logo Play】\nL3: \nL4: search\nL5: \nL6: help_outline\nL7: \nL8: 【4†Image†fonts.gstatic.com】\nL9: \nL10: 【0†Games】【1†Apps】【2†Books】【3†Kids】\nL11: \nL12: 【5†Image: Icon image†play-lh.googleusercontent.com】【5†Image†play-lh.googleusercontent.com】\nL13: \nL14: 【5†Image: Icon image†play-lh.googleusercontent.com】\nL15: # Spin The Wheel - Random Picker\nL16: \nL17: 【6†noblepete】\nL18: \nL19: Contains ads In-app purchases\nL20: \nL21: 4.8 star\nL22: \nL23: 150K reviews info\nL24: \nL25: 【7†Image: Content rating†play-lh.googleusercontent.com】\nL26: \nL27: USK: All ages\nL28: \nL29: info\nL30: \nL31: 10M+\nL32: \nL33: Downloads\nL34: \nL35: Install\nL36: \nL37: Share\nL38: \nL39: Add to wishlist\nL40: \nL41: 【8†Image: Content rating†play-lh.googleusercontent.com】\nL42: \nL43: USK: All ages\nL44: \nL45: Users Interact, In-App Purchases\nL46: \nL47: 【9†Learn more†support.google.com】\nL48: \nL49: 【10†Image: Screenshot image†play-lh.googleusercontent.com】\nL50: \nL51: 【11†Image: Screenshot image†play-lh.googleusercontent.com】\nL52: 【12†Image: Screenshot image†play-lh.googleusercontent.com】\nL53: \nL54: