ns of colors\nL89: > Easily share your wheels and spin results with friends\nL90: > Quickly disable and re-enable wheel labels as needed\nL91: > Random result every time, no matter how hard the wheel was spun\nL92: If you want to have fun doing your raffle, giveaway or picking random name for a game then this app is exactly what you want to have!\nL93: In the Spin The Wheel - Random Picker the result is mathematically calculated and chosen randomly every time you spin the wheel, no matter how hard or easy the wheel was spun.\nL94: Create and spin custom wheels of fortune in the ultimate decision making app!\nL95: \nL96: Updated on\nL97: \nL98: Sep 12, 2026\nL99: \nL100: Entertainment\nL101: ## Data safety\nL102: \nL103: arrow_forward\nL104: \nL105: Safety starts with understanding how developers collect and share your data. Data privacy and security practices may vary based on your use, region, and age. The developer provided this information and may update it over time.\nL106: \nL107:   * 【20†Image: Icon image†play-lh.googleusercontent.com】\nL108: \nL109: This app may share these data types with third parties\nL110: \nL111: App info and performance and Device or other IDs\nL112: \nL113:   * 【21†Image: Icon image†play-lh.googleusercontent.com】\nL114: This app may collect these data types\nL115: \nL116: Personal info, Messages and 3 others\nL117: \nL118:   * 【22†Image: Icon image†play-lh.googleusercontent.com】\nL119: \nL120: Data is encrypted in transit\nL121: \nL122:   * 【23†Image: Icon image†play-lh.googleusercontent.com】\nL123: \nL124: You can request that data be deleted\nL125: \nL126: See details\nL127: ## Ratings and reviews\nL128: \nL129: Ratings and reviews are verified info_outline\nL130: \nL131: arrow_forward\nL132: \nL133: Ratings and reviews are verified info_outline\nL134: \nL135: phone_android Phone\nL136: \nL137: laptop Desktop\nL138: \nL139: tablet_android Tablet\nL140: \nL141: 4.8\nL142: \nL143: 135K reviews\nL144: \nL145: 5\nL146: \nL147: 4\nL148: \nL149: 3\nL150: \nL151: 2\nL152: \nL153: 1\nL154: \nL155: 【24†Image†play-lh.googleusercontent.com】\nL156: \nL157: Antoaneta Basiou\nL158: \nL159: more_vert\nL160: \nL161: August 21, 2026\nL162: its really nice it helps me with a lot of decisions like what to eat truth or dare where to go on vacation or what music to listen to. I like that I can customize wheels and make new ones so I cam adjust the options to my interests. it's also a good feature that i can increase the chance of one piece winning if im not sure if I want it to win or not. overall its an amazing app for me because its very useful for every day decisions.\nL163: \nL164: 21 people found this review helpful\nL165: \nL166: Did you find this helpful?\nL167: \nL168: Yes\nL169: \nL170: No\nL171: 【25†Image†play-lh.googleusercontent.com】\nL172: \nL173: Janelle Kelly\nL174: \nL175: more_vert\nL176: \nL177: July 31, 2026\nL178: \nL179: could have sworn there was a way to copy/paste a long list of entries because I did it once. now I can't do it. too many forced ads that make me sit there for a minute or more just to finish editing a setting. I don't mind the banners but the full screen unskippable ads need to be shorter or removed.\nL180: \nL181: 3 people found this review helpful\nL182: \nL183: Did you find this helpful?\nL184: \nL185: Yes\nL186: \nL187: No\nL188: \nL189: noblepete\nL190: \nL191: August 6, 2026\nL192: Hi there! Thanks for sharing your feedback. The option to paste a list is still available: you can find it by tapping the yellow \"Quick Wheel\" button on the main screen. Regarding the ads, showing them allows us to keep the entire app 100% free without forcing any paid subscriptions. We really appreciate your support!\nL193: \nL194: 【26†Image†play-lh.googleusercontent.com】\nL195: \nL196: Leirryjane Angela Tubid\nL197: \nL198: more_vert\nL199: \nL200: September 6, 2026\n"
